    "### Rule\n",
    "\n",
    "I will prioritize pages that are both **stale and visibly active in search**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The score is deliberately not fitted:\n",
    "\n",
    "`score = stale_flag × visible_flag × log1p(impressions_90d)`\n",
    "\n",
    "where:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `stale_flag = 1` when `days_since_last_update >= 180`\n",
    "- `visible_flag = 1` when `impressions_90d >= 300`\n",
    "- the single positive reason code is `stale_visible`\n",
    "- the action label is `refresh_review`\n",
    "\n",
    "This keeps the rule readable: an editor can see exactly why an item entered the queue and why higher-volume stale pages appear earlier.\n"
   ]
